   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>The graph below represents the function that gives the value of a computer in dollars, <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>, as a function of time, <span data-math=\"x\">x</span><em>,</em>&nbsp;measured in years since the time of purchase.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>What is the range for this graph and situation?</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Graph of a decreasing exponential function, x y plane, origin O.\" src=\"exercises/media/5d410d0ac4067c13.svg\"></p>",
